{
    "title": "Tuner & Metronome",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfb9 Easy to use and innovative must have features are all included.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 The most accurate chromatic tuner and professional hands-free metronome.\r\n\ud83d\udc4d Designed by musicians \u2192 super-fast and simple to use!\r\n\ud83c\udfbc [NEW] 4,000+ free sheet music pieces in our app.\r\n\r\n<b>With just one touch, you can:</b>\r\n\u2022 Start or stop the metronome\r\n\u2022 Turn on the tuner\r\n\u2022 Toggle flash light-, vibration-, and visual-mode metronome\r\n\u2022 Record your playing\r\n\u2022 Select rhythm patterns\r\n\r\n==========================================\r\n<b>\u2605 Features:</b>\r\n\u2022 Tuner with two modes:\r\n(1) chromatic tuner for measuring sound pitch and intensity\r\n(2) pitch fork mode\r\n\u2022 Customizable A4 frequency (default 440Hz)\r\n\u2022 Record your playing with our integrated one-touch recorder\r\n\u2022 Upload your own sheet music to the app, and record and practice while watching or following along\r\n\u2022 Our metronome never lags beats, ensuring accurate timing: a real metronome shouldn't lag\r\n\r\n<b>\u2605 Flash light metronome mode:</b>\r\nIf it's hard to hear the metronome due to volume limits or loud background noise, use the flash light metronome mode. You can easily feel the beats with flashes of light. Project the flashlight onto the wall and the entire wall can flash to the beats.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2605 Large and simple buttons:</b>\r\nStart or stop the metronome with ease, thanks to our big button.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2605 More features:</b>\r\n\u2022 Supports all instruments, including piano, guitar, ukulele, mandolin, violin, cello, viola, bass, drums, flute, and harmonica, among others.\r\n\u2022 Supports transposed instruments, such as B-flat clarinet, F horn, E-flat saxophone, D-flat piccolo, and more.\r\n\u2022 Scales practice\r\n\u2022 Precise beats per minute (BPM) control\r\n\u2022 BPM detector\r\n\u2022 Practice time tracker\r\n\u2022 High precision tuner\r\n\u2022 Visual metronome mode using the camera flash\r\n\u2022 Tuning fork and pitch pipe\r\n\r\n<b>\u2605 About Permissions:</b>\r\nFor Android 6 and above, microphone access is required for the recorder and tuner, and storage access is for the recorder. For older Android versions, camera access is needed for the flash light metronome, and phone status access is necessary to stop the metronome automatically during incoming calls.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udfb9 Easy to use and innovative must have features are all included.<br><br>\ud83c\udfb6 The most accurate chromatic tuner and professional hands-free metronome.<br>\ud83d\udc4d Designed by musicians \u2192 super-fast and simple to use!<br>\ud83c\udfbc [NEW] 4,000+ free sheet music pieces in our app.<br><br><b>With just one touch, you can:</b><br>\u2022 Start or stop the metronome<br>\u2022 Turn on the tuner<br>\u2022 Toggle flash light-, vibration-, and visual-mode metronome<br>\u2022 Record your playing<br>\u2022 Select rhythm patterns<br><br>==========================================<br><b>\u2605 Features:</b><br>\u2022 Tuner with two modes:<br>(1) chromatic tuner for measuring sound pitch and intensity<br>(2) pitch fork mode<br>\u2022 Customizable A4 frequency (default 440Hz)<br>\u2022 Record your playing with our integrated one-touch recorder<br>\u2022 Upload your own sheet music to the app, and record and practice while watching or following along<br>\u2022 Our metronome never lags beats, ensuring accurate timing: a real metronome shouldn&#39;t lag<br><br><b>\u2605 Flash light metronome mode:</b><br>If it&#39;s hard to hear the metronome due to volume limits or loud background noise, use the flash light metronome mode. You can easily feel the beats with flashes of light. Project the flashlight onto the wall and the entire wall can flash to the beats.<br><br><b>\u2605 Large and simple buttons:</b><br>Start or stop the metronome with ease, thanks to our big button.<br><br><b>\u2605 More features:</b><br>\u2022 Supports all instruments, including piano, guitar, ukulele, mandolin, violin, cello, viola, bass, drums, flute, and harmonica, among others.<br>\u2022 Supports transposed instruments, such as B-flat clarinet, F horn, E-flat saxophone, D-flat piccolo, and more.<br>\u2022 Scales practice<br>\u2022 Precise beats per minute (BPM) control<br>\u2022 BPM detector<br>\u2022 Practice time tracker<br>\u2022 High precision tuner<br>\u2022 Visual metronome mode using the camera flash<br>\u2022 Tuning fork and pitch pipe<br><br><b>\u2605 About Permissions:</b><br>For Android 6 and above, microphone access is required for the recorder and tuner, and storage access is for the recorder. For older Android versions, camera access is needed for the flash light metronome, and phone status access is necessary to stop the metronome automatically during incoming calls.",
